      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Human in the loop\nThe workflow posts a review link to Slack and pauses. The reviewer approves (fixing fields if needed) or rejects on the review page, which resumes this execution through its resume URL.",
